1
00:00:00,480 --> 00:00:01,800
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

2
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:03,600
♪Makes me a little shy♪

3
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:05,240
♪When you say you love me♪

4
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:06,800
♪It's more than I ever imagined♪

5
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:08,760
♪Slowly♪

6
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:10,520
♪Stay by my side♪

7
00:00:10,520 --> 00:00:13,880
♪Love is the warmth of everyday life♪

8
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:15,600
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

9
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:17,320
♪Makes me a little shy♪

10
00:00:17,320 --> 00:00:18,960
♪You lean your forehead against mine♪

11
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:20,680
♪Then you keep grinning like a fool♪

12
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:22,320
♪Little by little♪

13
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:23,640
♪You come closer to me♪

14
00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:27,400
♪A warm love song plays in my ear♪

15
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:29,760
=The One=

16
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:31,320
=Episode 2=

17
00:00:31,879 --> 00:00:33,159
No reply on WeChat.
Won't answer my calls.

18
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:34,439
Su Yan.

19
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:39,119
Su Yan, do you have to do this?

20
00:00:44,120 --> 00:00:45,760
(Duan Cizhou,
partner at Xincheng Law Firm)

21
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:56,280
Who did you just sleep with?

22
00:00:57,320 --> 00:00:57,880
Duan Cizhou.

23
00:00:58,759 --> 00:01:00,119
You don't get to question me.

24
00:01:00,119 --> 00:01:01,439
I'm your fiance.

25
00:01:04,959 --> 00:01:05,519
Su Yan.

26
00:01:05,879 --> 00:01:06,959
We've known each other ten years.

27
00:01:07,319 --> 00:01:08,599
You're the only one I've ever loved.

28
00:01:08,599 --> 00:01:09,680
While sleeping with your secretary,

29
00:01:09,680 --> 00:01:10,560
actresses, and clients?

30
00:01:10,560 --> 00:01:11,599
And I'm the only one you love?

31
00:01:11,599 --> 00:01:12,319
That's because I knew

32
00:01:12,319 --> 00:01:13,200
you'd been assaulted.

33
00:01:27,239 --> 00:01:27,799
Forget it.

34
00:01:28,959 --> 00:01:29,879
Let's call it even.

35
00:01:31,239 --> 00:01:32,359
I can forgive you.

36
00:01:38,280 --> 00:01:38,879
You?

37
00:01:39,920 --> 00:01:41,159
Forgive me?

38
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:57,959
(Mr. Duan Cizhou and I)

39
00:01:57,959 --> 00:01:59,519
(are officially ending our engagement.)
(You deserve better. We're with you.)

40
00:01:59,519 --> 00:02:01,400
(Better days are ahead. Stay strong.)
(Grateful for the past. All the best.)

41
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:05,680
Wait.

42
00:02:05,680 --> 00:02:06,079
You...

43
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:07,879
Do you have to make this so ugly?

44
00:02:14,159 --> 00:02:16,120
Now all our friends and family know.

45
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:18,280
The whole firm is laughing at me.

46
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:19,439
Happy now?

47
00:02:19,840 --> 00:02:20,280
Huh?

48
00:02:20,719 --> 00:02:21,520
Satisfied?

49
00:02:28,319 --> 00:02:28,840
You...

50
00:02:28,840 --> 00:02:29,479
Ow, ow, ow!

51
00:02:32,319 --> 00:02:33,800
Forgot I boxed for five years?

52
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:34,800
Listen.

53
00:02:35,159 --> 00:02:37,520
At work, we still make a great team.

54
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:38,960
But as a couple,

55
00:02:39,199 --> 00:02:40,439
if the spark is gone,

56
00:02:40,879 --> 00:02:41,800
then so are we.

57
00:02:42,599 --> 00:02:43,080
From now on,

58
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:44,520
keep your hands to yourself.

59
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:46,319
And stop coming around.

60
00:02:47,599 --> 00:02:48,120
Su Yan!

61
00:02:48,439 --> 00:02:49,159
Su Yan!

62
00:02:57,759 --> 00:02:58,599
What are you doing here?

63
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:00,759
I don't want the suit.

64
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:02,479
Then throw it away.

65
00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:03,280
Su Yan.

66
00:03:03,599 --> 00:03:04,840
I know you're hurting.

67
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:05,800
But relationships...

68
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:06,439
Watch out.

69
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:10,560
Let go.

70
00:03:21,560 --> 00:03:23,199
I don't need a kid worrying about me.

71
00:03:23,759 --> 00:03:24,919
Don't get yourself involved.

72
00:03:25,680 --> 00:03:26,680
I don't want the hassle either.

73
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:37,240
(I know I'm not good enough
for you yet.)

74
00:03:38,479 --> 00:03:39,840
(But don't think of me as trouble.)

75
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:42,360
(Refund: 50,000 yuan)

76
00:03:44,280 --> 00:03:45,199
I'll go change.

77
00:03:45,439 --> 00:03:46,960
Then I'll take you somewhere to unwind.

78
00:03:47,439 --> 00:03:48,280
You've got this, ma'am.

79
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:49,919
Things will only get better.

80
00:03:55,120 --> 00:03:56,560
What's that boy's family like?

81
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:57,800
Why?

82
00:03:58,159 --> 00:03:58,840
(Wen Yining)
Did that cutie

83
00:03:58,840 --> 00:04:00,599
(Doctor, Su Yan's best friend)
catch our top lawyer's eye?

84
00:04:02,439 --> 00:04:03,120
Him?

85
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:05,000
His dad left when he was little.

86
00:04:05,159 --> 00:04:06,520
His mom remarried an abusive man.

87
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:09,280
He ended up in juvie
for protecting his mom.

88
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:11,199
He's really devoted to his mom.

89
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:14,159
He takes care of her all by himself.

90
00:04:14,159 --> 00:04:15,680
All his money goes to her medical bills.

91
00:04:16,879 --> 00:04:18,759
(He's struggling enough as it is,)

92
00:04:18,759 --> 00:04:20,040
(yet he still tried to comfort me.)

93
00:04:20,399 --> 00:04:21,639
(He really is just a kid.)

94
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:23,839
Can you find the best rehab specialist?

95
00:04:24,319 --> 00:04:25,079
I'll cover the cost.

96
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:27,720
Why?

97
00:04:29,319 --> 00:04:30,319
To...

98
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:33,480
reward him.

99
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:36,519
Your love life's a mess,

100
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:38,800
and you're still playing guardian angel?

101
00:04:43,319 --> 00:04:44,160
Slow down.

102
00:04:52,519 --> 00:04:53,240
How are you adjusting

103
00:04:53,519 --> 00:04:54,120
to life outside?

104
00:04:54,319 --> 00:04:55,040
I'll manage.

105
00:04:55,959 --> 00:04:56,639
These past two years...

106
00:04:57,240 --> 00:04:58,879
Thanks for taking care of my mom, Sun.

107
00:05:00,839 --> 00:05:01,279
How are you going to thank me?

108
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:03,240
(Sun Ye, nightclub manager)

109
00:05:03,240 --> 00:05:05,199
With a face like yours,

110
00:05:05,199 --> 00:05:06,160
you could make good money.

111
00:05:06,319 --> 00:05:07,519
Bet some sugar mama would love you.

112
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:09,240
Give it a shot.

113
00:05:10,480 --> 00:05:11,360
Come on, try it.

114
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:21,600
You...

115
00:05:21,959 --> 00:05:22,839
Quit kidding around.

116
00:05:23,959 --> 00:05:25,000
I already like someone.

117
00:05:25,079 --> 00:05:25,519
Huh?

118
00:05:26,199 --> 00:05:26,439
You...

119
00:05:27,199 --> 00:05:28,240
You just got out!

120
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:31,560
When did you

121
00:05:31,560 --> 00:05:32,759
get a girlfriend?

122
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:36,160
She's way out of my league.

123
00:05:37,959 --> 00:05:38,839
Dummy.

124
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:43,839
(Su Yan?)

125
00:05:44,160 --> 00:05:45,279
(Could she be here to...)

126
00:05:45,519 --> 00:05:46,319
Well?

127
00:05:46,319 --> 00:05:47,279
Anyone catch your eye?

128
00:05:50,199 --> 00:05:51,439
Why'd you bring them here?

129
00:05:51,959 --> 00:05:53,279
I asked you here to drink with me,

130
00:05:53,839 --> 00:05:54,839
then take me home when I get drunk.

131
00:05:55,439 --> 00:05:57,360
What's the fun in just drinking?

132
00:05:57,360 --> 00:05:58,439
Men get to go out and have fun.

133
00:05:58,439 --> 00:05:59,160
Why can't we?

134
00:06:03,079 --> 00:06:03,680
Then

135
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:04,720
let's see another round.

136
00:06:05,399 --> 00:06:05,920
No, thanks.

137
00:06:06,600 --> 00:06:07,439
Really, I'm good.

138
00:06:19,240 --> 00:06:20,319
This one's good.

139
00:06:21,279 --> 00:06:22,639
He's definitely your type.

140
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:31,439
Ladies,

141
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:32,399
this is

142
00:06:32,879 --> 00:06:34,680
Yese's new top escort.

143
00:06:35,279 --> 00:06:35,759
Brand-new.

144
00:06:35,920 --> 00:06:36,560
Totally innocent.

145
00:06:39,839 --> 00:06:40,759
So...

146
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:43,399
you're a male escort.

147
00:06:43,439 --> 00:06:44,439
Oh my gosh!

148
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:46,720
You're the cute guy who brings
his mom to rehab!

149
00:07:01,839 --> 00:07:03,199
So tonight,

150
00:07:03,199 --> 00:07:04,279
you're upset

151
00:07:04,839 --> 00:07:06,120
and came here for an escort?

152
00:07:07,800 --> 00:07:09,279
Looking for a sugar mama tonight?

153
00:07:09,279 --> 00:07:09,879
Su Yan.

154
00:07:10,759 --> 00:07:12,160
I'm not a male escort.

155
00:07:12,279 --> 00:07:13,399
And I don't want a sugar mama.

156
00:07:14,439 --> 00:07:15,439
But

157
00:07:15,439 --> 00:07:16,480
if you really want

158
00:07:16,480 --> 00:07:17,639
a male escort here tonight,

159
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:21,199
could you just pick me?

160
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:29,079
Su Yan.

161
00:07:29,439 --> 00:07:31,519
I know breakups really hurt.

162
00:07:32,480 --> 00:07:33,360
But this place

163
00:07:33,360 --> 00:07:34,399
is full of shady people.

164
00:07:35,319 --> 00:07:35,519
I...

165
00:07:35,519 --> 00:07:36,120
Cheng Lin.

166
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:38,639
Trying to lecture me?

167
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:47,000
What if I told you

168
00:07:48,439 --> 00:07:50,000
the one I want tonight

169
00:07:52,319 --> 00:07:53,279
is you?

170
00:08:03,480 --> 00:08:04,880
(Su Yan.)

171
00:08:04,880 --> 00:08:06,600
(Tell me.)

172
00:08:07,080 --> 00:08:08,800
(What would make you feel better?)

173
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:12,840
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

174
00:08:12,840 --> 00:08:16,080
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

175
00:08:16,080 --> 00:08:19,600
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

176
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:23,360
♪But you said time would make it fade♪

177
00:08:38,360 --> 00:08:41,840
♪Memories pile up, moment by moment♪

178
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:45,480
♪One careless word brings my walls down♪

179
00:08:45,480 --> 00:08:48,680
♪I escape the past, then fall back in♪

180
00:08:48,680 --> 00:08:52,360
♪Longing twists into a hopeless knot♪

181
00:08:52,360 --> 00:08:55,760
♪Pulled by the past
till my world fades out♪

182
00:08:55,760 --> 00:08:59,440
♪I hum this song alone♪

183
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:03,280
♪Counting every fleeting moment♪

184
00:09:03,280 --> 00:09:07,360
♪Every corner still reminds me of you♪

185
00:09:07,360 --> 00:09:10,640
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

186
00:09:10,640 --> 00:09:14,240
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

187
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:17,720
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

188
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:22,600
♪But you said time would make it fade♪
